#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Attack-surface reduction inspired by Chris Rohlf (@struct).

https://www.anthropic.com/research/attack-surface-reduction

This reconstructs the published three-pass method, not Anthropic's unpublished
skill. Requires Python 3.10+, Git, and Codex (Astra by default) or Claude Code.
See STRUCT.md for usage.
The filename deliberately has no .py suffix: struct.py shadows Python's stdlib.
"""
